  "title": "Butterscotch Brownies",
  "description": "These butterscotch brownies are oozing with brown sugary goodness. They're delicious plain, but they're out of this world topped with coffee frosting!",
  "authors": [
    "Anna Pages"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-09-25T18:56:40-04:00",
